# steps/free-names.md M2: a waited check runs where it was checked -- here inside the if body, whose field j it reads;
# the scope stack is part of the site.  The caller's int k + size_t j is a mix, refused at the value.
fn: peek (int: t) size_t
    if: t > 0
        size_t: j 3U
        return: k + j
    return: 0U
fn: m () size_t
    int: k 5
    return: peek(1)

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
